BT /F2 11 Tf 40 370.0 Td (1. Introduction & Architectural Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 355.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 343.5 Td (The **Inter-Company Transactions** app transforms ERPNext into a multi-entity conglomerate platform. It solves four foundational challenges in group corporate accounting:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 332.0 Td (1. **Double Data Entry:** When Entity A sells goods to Entity B, Entity B's purchase order/receipt/invoice is created automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 320.5 Td (2. **Transfer Pricing Non-Compliance:** Dynamically computes markups, resale prices, and arm's-length benchmarks across tax jurisdictions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 309.0 Td (3. **Liquidity Friction:** Consolidates multiple reciprocal invoices into single minimal multilateral netting settlements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 297.5 Td (4. **Group Financial Consolidation:** Eliminates internal double-counting of AR/AP, sales, and COGS for parent holding companies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 286.0 Td () Tj ET
0.85 0.85 0.85 RG 40 274.5 m 572 274.5 l S 0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 264.5 Td () Tj ET
