BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 238.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 226.5 Td (Step 1: Open the Control Console) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 213.5 Td (In ERPNext Desk, navigate to **Workspace > Inter Company** or enter the route directly in your browser:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 198.0 Td (/app/inter-company-console) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 182.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 171.0 Td (Step 2: Launch the Wizard) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 158.0 Td (1. On the top right of the Inter-Company Control Console, click the **Quick Setup Wizard** button.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 146.5 Td (2. Select:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 135.0 Td (- **Main Company \(Entity A\)**: e.g., *Headquarters Inc.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 124.0 Td (- **Counterparty Company \(Entity B\)**: e.g., *Distribution Subsidiary Ltd.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 113.0 Td (3. Click **Establish Connection**.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 101.5 Td () Tj ET
Q
endstream
