BT /F2 11 Tf 40 562.5 Td (3. Deep Dive into Core DocTypes & Configurations) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 547.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 536.0 Td (3.1 Intercompany Transaction Link) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 523.0 Td (\225 **Location:** `Inter Company > Intercompany Transaction Link`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 511.5 Td (\225 **Purpose:** The primary routing engine defining which sister companies trade with each other.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 500.0 Td (\225 **Key Fields:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 488.5 Td (  - `Main Company`: The initiating parent or sister company.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 477.0 Td (  - `Enabled`: Master switch for transaction triggering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 465.5 Td (  - `Auto Create Internal Parties`: Automatically builds missing customer/supplier records if checked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 454.0 Td (  - `Companies Table`: Child table listing counterparty entities, their specific Internal Customer ID, and Internal Supplier ID.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 442.5 Td (  - `Transaction Types Table`: Defines specific document routing pairs, whether target docs are created as Draft or automatically Submitted, and custom account overrides.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 431.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 419.5 Td (3.2 Inter Company Settings) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 406.5 Td (\225 **Location:** `Inter Company > Inter Company Settings`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 395.0 Td (\225 **Purpose:** Global environment configurations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 383.5 Td (\225 **Key Settings:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 372.0 Td (  - `Execution Mode`:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 360.5 Td (    - *Synchronous:* Targets created immediately on save/submit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 349.0 Td (    - *Background \(Queue\):* Jobs enqueued via Redis queue for high-volume transactions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 337.5 Td (  - `Deployment Mode`:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 326.0 Td (    - *Local Multi-Company \(Single Database\):* Both entities reside on the same bench site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 314.5 Td (    - *Federated Cross-Site \(REST API\):* Entities operate on separate ERPNext instances across data centers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 303.0 Td (  - `Default Transfer Rate Method`: Default pricing fallback \(`Source Document Rate`, `Cost / Valuation Rate`, `Cost + Markup %`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 291.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 280.0 Td (3.3 Transfer Pricing Policy \(OECD Compliance\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 267.0 Td (\225 **Location:** `Inter Company > Transfer Pricing Policy`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 255.5 Td (\225 **Purpose:** Enforces OECD arm's-length transfer pricing rules between specific sister entity pairs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 244.0 Td (\225 **Pricing Methods:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 232.5 Td (  - **Cost Plus Markup %:** Takes source warehouse FIFO/moving average valuation rate and adds a configured markup percentage \(e.g., Cost + 15%\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 221.0 Td (  - **Resale Price Method:** Takes downstream retail selling price and deducts distributor margin % \(e.g., Retail - 20%\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 209.5 Td (  - **Comparable Uncontrolled Price \(CUP\):** Applies predefined market benchmark rates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 198.0 Td (  - **Fixed Transfer Rate:** Fixed negotiated price contract per item.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 186.5 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 175.0 Td (3.4 Inter Company Netting Cycle) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 162.0 Td (\225 **Location:** `Inter Company > Inter Company Netting Cycle`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 150.5 Td (\225 **Purpose:** Multilateral settlement of cross-company debts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 50 139.0 Td (\225 **Algorithm:**) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 127.5 Td (  - Pulls all outstanding unpaid Sales and Purchase Invoices between participant entities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 116.0 Td (  - Calculates net debtor/creditor balances.) Tj ET
Q
