BT /F2 11 Tf 40 410.0 Td (4. Step-by-Step Practical Examples) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 395.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 383.5 Td (Example A: Order-to-Cash & Procure-to-Pay Mirroring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 370.5 Td (**Scenario:** Entity A \(*Acme Mfg*\) sells 100 units of "Widget A" to sister company Entity B \(*Acme Retail*\) at $50/unit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 359.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 347.5 Td (1. **Step 1:** In *Acme Mfg*, create a new **Sales Order**.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 336.0 Td (2. **Step 2:** Select Customer: `Acme Retail \(Internal\)`. Add Item `Widget A`, Qty `100`, Rate `$50`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 324.5 Td (3. **Step 3:** Click **Submit**.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 313.0 Td (4. **Step 4:** Inspect the form. A blue alert banner appears:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 301.5 Td (   ```) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 290.0 Td (   Inter Company: Linked Purchase Order PO-2026-00042 has been automatically created in Acme Retail.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 278.5 Td (   ```) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 267.0 Td (5. **Step 5:** Switch company view to *Acme Retail*. Notice **Purchase Order** `PO-2026-00042` exists with Supplier `Acme Mfg \(Internal\)` for 100 units of Widget A.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 255.5 Td (6. **Step 6:** Deliver goods by creating a **Delivery Note** in *Acme Mfg*. Upon submission, a corresponding **Purchase Receipt** is automatically created in *Acme Retail*.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 244.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 40 232.5 Td (Example B: Transfer Pricing Margin Calculation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 219.5 Td (**Scenario:** Headquarters manufactures a customized component with a valuation cost of $200. Regulatory guidelines require a **15% Cost-Plus markup** for sales to foreign subsidiaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 208.0 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 196.5 Td (1. Create a **Transfer Pricing Policy**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 185.0 Td (- `Policy Name`: *US to EU Component Transfer*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 174.0 Td (- `Source Company`: *Acme HQ*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 163.0 Td (- `Target Company`: *Acme Europe B.V.*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 152.0 Td (- `Pricing Method`: *Cost Plus Markup %*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 65 141.0 Td (- `Markup Percentage`: `15.0%`) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 130.0 Td (2. Save and set Status to `Active`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 118.5 Td (3. Create a Sales Order in *Acme HQ* for *Acme Europe B.V.*.) Tj ET
